OL,3,GNEWSA'An utter disgrace' - commuters
OL,4,Ahit out as Translink off-peak discount
OL,5,Aends
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome commuters have expressed their
OL,8,Fdisappointment as the removal of an
OL,9,Foff-peak discount on public transport
OL,10,Fcomes into effect.
OL,12,FFrom Monday morning, a 25% discount
OL,13,Fended on off-peak return travel on
OL,14,Ftrains, Ulsterbus and Goldliner
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,17,FTranslink, which operates public
OL,18,Ftransport in Northern Ireland, blamed
OL,19,Fthe move - and cuts to some other
OL,20,Fdiscounts - on financial pressures.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
