OL,3,GNEWSA'An utter disgrace' - commuters
OL,4,Ahit out as Translink off-peak discount
OL,5,Aends
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere are no changes to standard fares
OL,8,Fwhich have been frozen since June 2024
OL,9,Fand the 50% discount offered to 16-23
OL,10,Fyear-olds with a yLink card is also
OL,11,Funchanged.
